### Enkel fråga (ny session)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "personality": "coder",
  "message": "Hur skriver jag en for-loop i Java?"
}

### Samma session (minne i konversationen)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "personality": "helper",
  "message": "Hej!",
  "sessionId": "user-123-abc"
}

### Uppföljningsfråga i samma session
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "personality": "helper",
  "message": "Vad sa jag nyss?",
  "sessionId": "user-123-abc"
}
